      "body": "## Purpose\r\n\r\n`docs/design/hybrid_kv_cache_manager.md` still described the manager as it was in v0.10.1; current is v0.28.0. Two claims from that version no longer match current code, and some newer manager classes went undocumented.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n- `HybridKVCacheCoordinator` is no longer limited to two KV cache groups — documented the general fixed-point cache-hit search.\r\n- Mamba prefix caching is implemented, not \"work in progress\".\r\n- Listed the newer `SingleTypeKVCacheManager` subclasses (RSWA, circular-buffer, chunked-local, cross-attention, attention-sink).\r\n\r\n## Test plan\r\n\r\nDocs-only change. Verified each claim against current source (`vllm/v1/core/kv_cache_coordinator.py`, `vllm/v1/core/single_type_kv_cache_manager.py`). `pre-commit` docs lint passed locally.",
